# Deploy config: the Cloudflare Worker serves this repo's root as its asset
# directory, so anything here that isn't part of the site has to be named.
# gitignore syntax; this file must stay at the root of the assets directory.

# The build clones the repo, and .git/objects/pack is well over the 25 MiB
# per-asset limit — this is what fails the deploy if it's missing.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore

# Screenshot masters: ~44 MB of 2580x5592 PNGs, source material only. The page
# loads assets/screens/{light,dark}/*.webp, built from these by export_web.py.
# Two of them (60_profile, 62_profile_appearance) show a real email address.
assets/screens/v4

# Mascot source art. The page only loads the .webp exports (plus face.png for
# the favicon); these are the originals they were made from.
assets/zeb/ai.png
assets/zeb/budget.png
assets/zeb/icon.png
assets/zeb/mealplan.png
assets/zeb/wave.png
assets/zeb/zeb-ai.png
assets/zeb/zeb-budget.png
assets/zeb/zeb-mealplan.png
assets/zeb/zebite logo.png

# Design reference material. The mp4 in here is ~40 MB — well over Cloudflare's
# 25 MiB per-asset limit, so leaving it unnamed fails the deploy outright.
assets/want

# Repo docs
README.md
